WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.963
ALEX: OpenAI just gave healthcare
AI the ability to

00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:05.926
ALEX: actually *do* things — not
answer questions, but

00:00:05.926 --> 00:00:08.888
ALEX: click through software, fill
out forms, move across

00:00:08.888 --> 00:00:11.851
ALEX: systems. That's a different
animal entirely.

00:00:11.961 --> 00:00:13.859
JAMIE: And they dropped more than
twenty new plugins

00:00:13.859 --> 00:00:15.757
JAMIE: on the same day. That's not
an update,

00:00:15.757 --> 00:00:17.655
JAMIE: that's a statement.

00:00:17.765 --> 00:00:19.813
RUFUS: The statement being: we
would like to be

00:00:19.813 --> 00:00:21.860
RUFUS: inside your hospital's
software stack before anyone asks

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.908
RUFUS: permission.

00:00:24.121 --> 00:00:26.320
ALEX: We'll get into what that
means. November 17th,

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.519
ALEX: 2026.
